public schools just fail?

00:36:29.387 --> 00:36:31.289 align:start size:84% position:16%
That would just
clear out the brush.

00:36:32.757 --> 00:36:34.392
- If you do this for Title
IV, too, that would count.

00:36:34.392 --> 00:36:35.693
Title IV is the
loans we give out

00:36:35.693 --> 00:36:37.595
$100 billion of loans
