just absolutely horrid.

00:36:45.236 --> 00:36:47.371 align:start size:88% position:13%
And these schools
probably care a lot more

00:36:47.371 --> 00:36:49.974
about whatever crazy ethnic
studies things they're doing,

00:36:49.974 --> 00:36:51.642 align:start size:88% position:13%
whatever racism they're
teaching our kids

00:36:51.642 --> 00:36:54.011
