anything helpful for America.

00:36:54.011 --> 00:36:56.080
So yes, Japan did this recently,

00:36:56.080 --> 00:36:59.984
they closed a bunch
of their weaker,

00:36:59.984 --> 00:37:02.987 align:start position:0%
